.cc/021X2PFH/straw.jpg\n\n視聴者はイリヤにこのようなイチゴ味のアイスクリームコーンを差し出している：\n\nhttps://i.postimg.cc/c4ChLPCn/00647468-A-Strawberry-Ice-Cream-Cone.jpg\n\nイリヤは驚いた表情で、\"どうして私がイチゴ好きだとわかったの？\"と聞いている。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@silver_corn/works/42", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 34718, "client_id": 405734, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fdcf5425/uploads/origins/ae82045c-74cf-4728-8f76-601c1bcc26d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aca9c10331281e9fa76f30d5c189aed3", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fdcf5425/uploads/origins/ae82045c-74cf-4728-8f76-601c1bcc26d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=51e2d7e9d1cf90e2b9d899c8e15918ee", "src_set": ""}, "body": "紅閻魔と雑賀孫一には、お正月にのんびりと楽しんでもらいたい。お好きなように描いてください。\n\n紅閻魔\nhttps://imgur.com/a/uSprM6f\nhttps://imgur.com/a/i3Owf8y\n\n雑賀孫一\nhttps://imgur.com/a/sid6MfA", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@silver_corn/works/41", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 34718, "client_id": 2801467, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5e8d697/uploads/origins/144eff4f-0d6a-4e21-8407-856501fd22da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29908c4cb4337fc594a8f96cd8403ac4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5e8d697/uploads/origins/144eff4f-0d6a-4e21-8407-856501fd22da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dc27f2c534d465c7dda737c25fe03060", "src_set": ""}, "body": "